OL,3,GNEWSAArmed police arrest group on
OL,4,Asuspicion of drug supply
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmed police have arrested seven people
OL,7,Fon suspicion of drug supply in
OL,8,FChesterfield.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police attended a property
OL,11,Fin Devonshire Close, Newbold, on
OL,12,FThursday morning.
OL,14,FA 16-year-old boy, three men, 18, 25
OL,15,Fand 28, and three women, 24, 37 and 39,
OL,16,Fwere arrested on suspicion of being
OL,17,Fconcerned in the supply of Class A
OL,18,Fdrugs.
OL,20,FThe group remains in police custody
OL,21,Fwhile investigations continue, the
OL,22,Fforce added.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
